{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061366/block/singleImage/3254393/wm/01M6AR3AGAXWGPMF72YB9MRFT2.jpeg?updatedAt=1793509747\"/><figcaption>有報章本月起加價。(am730記者攝)</figcaption></figure><p>3份本地報章本月起加價。其中《明報》今日(1日)起由每份12元，加至15元。《信報》及《經濟日報》亦將於明日加價，《信報》由15元加至18元；《經濟日報》由12元加至15元。</p><p>本港對上一次有中文報章加價，是在2024年11月，是事隔兩年再有本地報章加價。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:51.618280+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T03:06:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T04:18:46.250222+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:35.114527+00:00","content_hash":"596dfe500b7423c4e80ddd60295f2dbdf4d470d58e3bdce28fab341c1ed8dace","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:51.618280+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}